<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Wanpot - All-in-One Smart App</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/wanpot.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Include Font Awesome -->
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css"
/>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
      color: #f8fafc;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .navbar {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    nav ul li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    nav ul li a:hover {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    /* LOGO SECTION */
    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .logo img {
      height: 40px;
      width: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .logo-text {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* GET STARTED BUTTON */
    /* GET STARTED BUTTON - OUTLINED STYLE */
    .get-started-btn {
      background: transparent;
      color: #38bdf8 !important;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.3rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      background-image: linear-gradient(#0f172a, #0f172a),
                        linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4);
      background-origin: border-box;
      background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .get-started-btn:hover {
      color: #fff !important;
      background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4),
                        linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(6,182,212,0.4);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }


    /* HERO SECTION */
    .hero {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(59,130,246,0.3), transparent 70%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(6,182,212,0.3), transparent 70%);
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.6rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .hero .cta-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4);
      padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .hero .cta-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(6,182,212,0.4);
    }

    /* FEATURES */
    .features {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 4rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .features h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      transition: 0.4s;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 2.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* ABOUT SECTION */
    .about {
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e3a8a, #2563eb);
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .about h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav ul {
        display: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        position: absolute;
        right: 20px;
        top: 70px;
        width: 200px;
        background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      nav ul.active {
        display: flex;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: block;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.1rem;
      }
    }
 

    /*  */
  a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .feature-icon i {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .feature-card:hover .feature-icon i {
    color: #ffb703;
    transform: scale(1.2);
    transition: 0.3s ease;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="navbar">
      <!-- LOGO SECTION -->
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="/images/wanpot.ico" alt="Wanpot Logo">
      <span class="logo-text">Wanpot</span>
    </div>
     <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#download">Download</a></li>
        <li><a href="/login" class="btn-get-started">Login</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
      <div class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>One App, Many Tools — Welcome to <span style="color:#38bdf8;">Wanpot</span></h1>
    <p>The all-in-one smart application designed to simplify student life, empower professionals, and make daily productivity effortless — everything in one pot!</p>
    <a href="/signup" class="cta-btn">Get Started</a>
  </section>

  
<section class="features" id="features">
  <h2>What's Inside the Pot 🍲</h2>
  <div class="features-grid">

    <!-- New Student Features -->
     <a href="/ai" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i></div>
      <h3>AI Assistance</h3>
       <p>Chat with our smart AI tutor — get instant help, answers, and explanations anytime.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/notes" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-book"></i></div>
      <h3>Note Keeper</h3>
      <p>Save lecture notes and ideas in a clean interface.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/gpa-calculator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i></div>
      <h3>GPA Calculator</h3>
      <p>Compute grades and GPA easily for academic tracking.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/dictionary" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i></div>
      <h3>Dictionary & Word Finder</h3>
      <p>Offline English dictionary and synonyms at your fingertips.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/unit-converter" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i></div>
      <h3>Unit Converter</h3>
      <p>Convert measurements, currency, volume, and more.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/flashcards" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-clone"></i></div>
      <h3>Flashcards & Study Quiz</h3>
      <p>Create flashcards and quizzes to improve memory retention.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/pomodoro" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-hourglass-half"></i></div>
      <h3>Pomodoro Timer</h3>
      <p>Boost focus and productivity with a smart timer.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/equation-solver" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-square-root-variable"></i></div>
      <h3>Equation Solver (Math AI)</h3>
      <p>Step-by-step solutions to complex math problems.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/pdf-tools" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-pdf"></i></div>
      <h3>PDF Tools</h3>
      <p>Merge, split, or compress PDFs for easy handling.</p>
    </a>

    <!-- Corporate Features -->
    <a href="/expense-tracker" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i></div>
      <h3>Expense Tracker</h3>
      <p>Track spending, budgets, and financial reports efficiently.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/meeting-scheduler" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i></div>
      <h3>Meeting Scheduler / Reminder</h3>
      <p>Organize meetings and receive smart reminders.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/cv-builder" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-id-card"></i></div>
      <h3>Resume / CV Builder</h3>
      <p>Create professional CVs with clean templates quickly.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/file-converter" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></div>
      <h3>File Converter</h3>
      <p>Convert images, documents, and text between formats.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/voice-recorder" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-microphone"></i></div>
      <h3>Voice-to-Text Note Recorder</h3>
      <p>Quickly record and transcribe your ideas and meetings.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/task-planner" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-tasks"></i></div>
      <h3>Task Priority Planner</h3>
      <p>Plan tasks smartly with urgency and importance indicators.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/signature-generator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text"></i></div>
      <h3>Email Signature Generator</h3>
      <p>Create professional email signatures in seconds.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/translator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-language"></i></div>
      <h3>Quick Translator</h3>
      <p>Translate text quickly in multiple languages.</p>
    </a>

        <!-- Existing features -->
    <a href="/calculator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-calculator"></i></div>
      <h3>Scientific Calculator</h3>
      <p>Perform accurate calculations with a beautiful modern interface.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/stopwatch" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-stopwatch"></i></div>
      <h3>Smart Stopwatch</h3>
      <p>Track your activities with precision timing.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/quiz" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i></div>
      <h3>Tech Quiz & Study Tools</h3>
      <p>Challenge your brain or prepare for tests the fun way.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/api/typists/game" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-keyboard"></i></div>
      <h3>Typing Game</h3>
      <p>Improve your typing skills with interactive fun.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/todo" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-list-check"></i></div>
      <h3>To-Do List</h3>
      <p>Organize tasks efficiently for productivity.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/password-generator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div>
      <h3>Password Generator</h3>
      <p>Create strong, secure passwords instantly.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/qrcode-generator" class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-qrcode"></i></div>
      <h3>QR Code Generator</h3>
      <p>Generate QR codes for links, contacts, or events.</p>
    </a>

  </div>
</section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2>The Wanpot Philosophy</h2>
    <p>In Sierra Leone, “Wanpot” means putting everything in one pot — and that’s exactly what this app does. We blend tools for learning, productivity, creativity, and life management — all served hot in one digital experience!</p>
  </section>

  <footer>
  <p>© 2025 Wanpot | Built with ❤️ in Sierra Leone by <strong>Kharis Pro Tech</strong> | Empowering Productivity Everywhere</p>
</footer>

  <script>
    function toggleMenu() {
      document.querySelector('nav ul').classList.toggle('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
